    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Trust Deed for a Self Managed Superannuation Fund ",
            "block_bbox": [
                300,
                89,
                885,
                122
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e. Any Tax payable on a Benefit must be deducted before the payment is made to the Member.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                222,
                181,
                1029,
                239
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "17. Pension Mode:",
            "block_bbox": [
                147,
                342,
                359,
                366
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a.When conditions to commute to pension are satisfied by a Member and the Member elects to commute to Pension Mode, the Trustees must ensure.that the Member Benefits are locked into the applicable Pension Mode.",
            "block_bbox": [
                226,
                404,
                1073,
                490
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b.  Pension payments to the Member will be made in terms of the ATO Guidelines and any other regulations applicable to pension accounts.",
            "block_bbox": [
                226,
                524,
                1004,
                582
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "TRUSTEES ",
            "block_bbox": [
                147,
                674,
                290,
                696
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "18. Trustee Requirements:",
            "block_bbox": [
                149,
                793,
                447,
                817
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. By signing this Trust Deed, the Trustees accept their appointment to manage the Fund in accordance with the requirements set out in this Trust.Deed.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                225,
                880,
                1064,
                959
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. The Trustees must act jointly in the interest and to the benefit of the Fund Member/s only.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                224,
                995,
                1061,
                1049
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. The Trustees will not receive any payment to carry out their duties as Trustees of the Fund.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                223,
                1085,
                1015,
                1138
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d. Any Trustee may call a meeting of all the Trustees by giving at least 5days prior notice to each of the other Trustees. The Trustee will notify the Fund administrator. All Members are responsible for ensuring their contact details are correct.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                224,
                1173,
                1072,
                1283
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "e.A quorum consists of all the Trustees. If all Trustees are not in attendance within 15 minutes of the scheduled starting time of the meeting, the meeting will be adjourned for 5 days.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                226,
                1318,
                1067,
                1404
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "f. On the day of the adjourned meeting, a quorum will consist of those Trustees in attendance at the start of the meeting.",
            "block_bbox": [
                227,
                1438,
                1012,
                1495
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "number",
            "block_content": "8",
            "block_bbox": [
                587,
                1648,
                600,
                1669
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": null
        }
    ],
